# Narrow on purpose. Only two kinds of file here break under CRLF:
#
#   *.patch  GNU patch inside the alpine build stage reads these. A CRLF patch
#            fails with "malformed patch" or applies garbage.
#   *.sh     start.sh runs under /bin/sh in the container. CRLF gives
#            "\r: not found" and the container dies at boot.
#
# server.js and the Dockerfile are stored CRLF upstream of this change and
# build fine that way. Do NOT add `* text=auto eol=lf` here: it rewrites every
# line of them and buries the real diff.
*.patch   text eol=lf
*.sh      text eol=lf
